ndidates still do not validate, so I’m removing that ranking assumption. I’ll exhaust its 244 observed legal placements against the four bbox-exact second-piece placements, keeping the uniquely strongest first-piece state and performing the correct fourth-use scanner sweep.\n\n## Preserved local probes\n\n- `probe_bfs.py` (788 bytes)\n- `probe_exhaustive.py` (1703 bytes)\n- `probe_level6.py` (7819 bytes)\n\nRun or inspect the smallest relevant probe before writing another one.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
